    { "type": "text", "id": "neon_t", "x": 850, "y": 180, "width": 220, "height": 50, "text": "Neon Postgres\nneon-teal-book, us-east-1\nDATABASE_URL (pooler)", "originalText": "Neon Postgres\nneon-teal-book, us-east-1\nDATABASE_URL (pooler)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170021, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170022, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "neon", "lineHeight": 1.25 },
    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "noworkers", "x": 1140, "y": 160, "width": 340, "height": 90, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170023, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170024, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{ "id": "noworkers_t", "type": "text" }], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "noworkers_t", "x": 1150, "y": 170, "width": 320, "height": 70, "text": "workers: NOWHERE\nno host runs the evidence / inference /\nresolution loops, so claims stop at\nREVIEW_REQUESTED", "originalText": "workers: NOWHERE\nno host runs the evidence / inference /\nresolution loops, so claims stop at\nREVIEW_REQUESTED", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170025, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170026, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "noworkers", "lineHeight": 1.25 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "env", "x": 40, "y": 265, "width": 1440, "height": 70, "text": "env on Vercel: OPENVERDICT_RELEASE_MANIFEST=config/release.testnet.json, DATABASE_URL (Neon integration), SUI_OPERATOR_SECRET_KEY, OPENVERDICT_AGENT_SEED,\nGONKA_ROUTER_API_KEY, OPENVERDICT_PUBLIC_WRITES=enabled, PGLITE_DATA_DIR, NEXT_PUBLIC_ENOKI_API_KEY, NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (baked at build).\nBlank values count as unset (readEnv). `vercel env pull` redacts CLI-added values, so never conclude \"env is empty\" from a pull. Env changes need a redeploy.\nFive stacked deploy faults were fixed on 08-29 to reach a healthy /api/status: see docs/CHECKPOINT-2026-08-29.md.", "originalText": "env on Vercel: OPENVERDICT_RELEASE_MANIFEST=config/release.testnet.json, DATABASE_URL (Neon integration), SUI_OPERATOR_SECRET_KEY, OPENVERDICT_AGENT_SEED,\nGONKA_ROUTER_API_KEY, OPENVERDICT_PUBLIC_WRITES=enabled, PGLITE_DATA_DIR, NEXT_PUBLIC_ENOKI_API_KEY, NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (baked at build).\nBlank values count as unset (readEnv). `vercel env pull` redacts CLI-added values, so never conclude \"env is empty\" from a pull. Env changes need a redeploy.\nFive stacked deploy faults were fixed on 08-29 to reach a healthy /api/status: see docs/CHECKPOINT-2026-08-29.md.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170027, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170028, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

