    { "type": "text", "id": "expected", "x": 40, "y": 380, "width": 600, "height": 22, "text": "WHAT THE DESIGN EXPECTS", "originalText": "WHAT THE DESIGN EXPECTS", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170031, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170032, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },
    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "container", "x": 40, "y": 420, "width": 620, "height": 100, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170033, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170034, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{ "id": "container_t", "type": "text" }], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "container_t", "x": 50, "y": 430, "width": 600, "height": 80, "text": "one container (Dockerfile / railway.json)\nnode scripts/start-production.mjs = next start + the 3 workers\nhealthcheck /api/status; any child death restarts the service\nall four processes share DATABASE_URL and the operator key", "originalText": "one container (Dockerfile / railway.json)\nnode scripts/start-production.mjs = next start + the 3 workers\nhealthcheck /api/status; any child death restarts the service\nall four processes share DATABASE_URL and the operator key", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170035, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170036, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "container", "lineHeight": 1.25 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "options", "x": 700, "y": 415, "width": 780, "height": 115, "text": "the two can coexist: keep Vercel for the site, run ONLY the workers elsewhere\nagainst the same DATABASE_URL and env.\n(a) a Railway / Fly / Render container built from the Dockerfile   <- recommended\n(b) a laptop for the demo window:\n    DATABASE_URL=<neon> pnpm tsx workers/<evidence|inference|resolution>-worker.ts\n(c) a Vercel Cron hitting a tick route: fragile, one tick can hold a 120 s model\n    call per juror, longer than a function is meant to live", "originalText": "the two can coexist: keep Vercel for the site, run ONLY the workers elsewhere\nagainst the same DATABASE_URL and env.\n(a) a Railway / Fly / Render container built from the Dockerfile   <- recommended\n(b) a laptop for the demo window:\n    DATABASE_URL=<neon> pnpm tsx workers/<evidence|inference|resolution>-worker.ts\n(c) a Vercel Cron hitting a tick route: fragile, one tick can hold a 120 s model\n    call per juror, longer than a function is meant to live", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170037, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170038, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "next", "x": 40, "y": 560, "width": 1440, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170039, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170040, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{ "id": "next_t", "type": "text" }], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "next_t", "x": 52, "y": 568, "width": 1416, "height": 64, "text": "WHAT HAPPENS ONCE A WORKER HOST EXISTS: a hosted claim still takes at least 45 min on the default ladder (commit deadline +30, reveal +45 are\nfloors on chain), 90 with a second round. Decide whether factCheckStart should apply a shorter demo ladder for the public site, then run one hosted\nclaim end to end (about 0.1 SUI) to close the last unproven link. Also unconfirmed: Google Auth Platform audience = In production, Enoki Save pressed.", "originalText": "WHAT HAPPENS ONCE A WORKER HOST EXISTS: a hosted claim still takes at least 45 min on the default ladder (commit deadline +30, reveal +45 are\nfloors on chain), 90 with a second round. Decide whether factCheckStart should apply a shorter demo ladder for the public site, then run one hosted\nclaim end to end (about 0.1 SUI) to close the last unproven link. Also unconfirmed: Google Auth Platform audience = In production, Enoki Save pressed.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 170041, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170042, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "next", "lineHeight": 1.25 }
  ],
